   'statement':'Provide a target-blind rule S that maps declared pre-composition FIN data (or one explicitly new fine relational observable) to: (i) cell-cell support, (ii) edge-strength ratios, and (iii) interaction functional class, equivariantly under cell relabeling and internal D12/common feature-frame gauge.',
   'anti_circularity':['Freeze S and its free parameters before revealing desired A7 spectral ratios or downstream geometry/locality scores.','Do not use the target A7 entries/eigenvalues or a desired graph metric as priors disguised as constraints.','Use one rule across at least two carrier sizes/topologies and score a held-out spectral/response relation without retuning.'],
